      "message": "nit: Suggested syntax change:\n\n```\npacket AvctpPacket {\n    transaction_label : 4,\n    packet_type: PacketType,\n    cr: MessageType,\n    ipid: 1,\n    _payload_,\n}\n\npacket AvctpSinglePacket : AvctpPacket(packet_type \u003d SINGLE_PACKET) {\n    pid: 16,\n    _payload_,\n}\n\npacket AvctpStartPacket : AvctpPacket(packet_type \u003d START_PACKET) {\n    number_of_packets: 8,\n    pid: 16,\n    _payload_,\n}\n\npacket AvctpContinuePacket : AvctpPacket(packet_type \u003d CONTINUE_PACKET) {\n    _payload_,\n}\n```",
